  "next_check": "none",
  "memo": "R08 holds, and Linkage is the sole adverse family. Although shipping is to the registered home, its recent registration prevents the household exception. No earlier outcome settles this order. Under §5.2, id_check is the only required check, and it passed. Therefore §5.3(a), applied within §6.6(b), requires clear and prohibits further adverse dispositions. Shared household use is the most plausible benign explanation; coordinated identities remain possible but unestablished. No further check is needed. This recommendation is advisory."
